+## Why
+
+Many visitors only want a board for an afternoon and are turned away because rentals are whole days only. Customers should be able to rent by the hour.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice`: the price of one hour of rental, in euro cents.
+- A rental shorter than a day whose start and end are both on the hour is priced at the item's hourly price times the number of hours.
+- An item without an `hourlyPrice` cannot be rented by the hour: `quote` and `book` throw for it.
+- Whole-day rentals, the long-stay discount and the no-overlap rule are unchanged; hourly bookings reserve their exact time range.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+- `equipment-rental`: Equipment registration, the period rules, Quote and Booking now cover hourly rentals.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/period.ts` (period parsing), `src/rental.ts` (equipment, pricing), their tests, and the README rental section.
+- `Equipment` gains an optional field; `Quote` and `Booking` keep the same fields.
